# Documentation, and source, for anything importable.
Shot doc
Alt :doc strings.Cut printing the function's signature and its documentation, offline, from the toolchain's own source
Also doc-src :doc -src strings.Cut printing the function's source, with the file and line it lives at
Caption :doc reads documentation — and with -src the source — for anything you can import, offline, from the code your build actually uses.
Headline Docs and source, at the prompt
Promo 16:9
Grid 80x18
Line :doc strings.Cut
Screenshot
Ctrl l
Wait Prompt
Line :doc -src strings.Cut
Screenshot doc-src
